[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14581.11, "timestamp": "04:03:01", "text": "一切。一切准备就绪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14584.309, "timestamp": "04:03:04", "text": "好，那就这么办吧。我明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14587.51, "timestamp": "04:03:07", "text": "我们能搞定。迪奥，我可以做到。我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14589.79, "timestamp": "04:03:09", "text": "照做。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14593.03, "timestamp": "04:03:13", "text": "是的。它是一种植物。这是一个，这不是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14596.389, "timestamp": "04:03:16", "text": "植物。这是一个计划。我们有计划了。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14599.15, "timestamp": "04:03:19", "text": "将按照计划执行。我希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14602.389, "timestamp": "04:03:22", "text": "所以。我真的很想调整一下我的日程安排。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14605.67, "timestamp": "04:03:25", "text": "这就是为什么我才利用这次合作机会的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14609.349, "timestamp": "04:03:29", "text": "合作死神合作对我来说是一种方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14612.59, "timestamp": "04:03:32", "text": "真的能改善我的睡眠"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14615.469, "timestamp": "04:03:35", "text": "人们会做的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14634.429, "timestamp": "04:03:54", "text": "总之，我去睡觉了。我的狗为什么会这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14638.269, "timestamp": "04:03:58", "text": "叫声？呃，是我的"}]